Env: box rad 10px wid 1.9 ht 1.0 "Patch envelope" "baseRevision, ops" at (0, 0)
Head: box rad 10px wid 1.9 ht 1.0 "Mutable head" "compare and swap" at Env + (3.1, 0)
Merge: box rad 10px wid 1.9 ht 1.0 "Merge validation" "after convergence" at Head + (0, -1.8)
Stop: box rad 10px wid 1.9 ht 1.0 "Evaluation stops" "both edits kept" at Merge + (-3.1, 0)
arrow from Env.e to Head.w "all or nothing"
arrow from Head.s to Merge.n "lanes converge"
arrow from Merge.w to Stop.e "cycle found"
